          "annotations": [],
          "text": "{\"stories\":[{\"id\":\"s000014\",\"rating\":{\"coherence\":8,\"style\":5,\"grammar\":9,\"storytelling\":6,\"overall\":6},\"note\":\"The lantern search finds the key and gets Lily inside, though the repeated name-led sentences make the telling feel mechanical.\",\"group_id\":0},{\"id\":\"s000028\",\"rating\":{\"coherence\":8,\"style\":5,\"grammar\":9,\"storytelling\":6,\"overall\":6},\"note\":\"The lantern search finds the key and gets Lily inside, though the repeated name-led sentences make the telling feel mechanical.\",\"group_id\":0},{\"id\":\"s000058\",\"rating\":{\"coherence\":8,\"style\":5,\"grammar\":9,\"storytelling\":6,\"overall\":6},\"note\":\"Sam finds the key with the lantern and reaches the book; the sequence is clear but reads like a list of actions.\",\"group_id\":0},{\"id\":\"s000023\",\"rating\":{\"coherence\":8,\"style\":5,\"grammar\":9,\"storytelling\":6,\"overall\":6},\"note\":\"Nora finds the missing key and enters to read, but the repetitive phrasing gives little sense of suspense or discovery.\",\"group_id\":0},{\"id\":\"s000036\",\"rating\":{\"coherence\":7,\"style\":5,\"grammar\":9,\"storytelling\":5,\"overall\":5},\"note\":\"A spare key lets Nora enter and read while the original remains missing; the promise and note resolve little beyond postponing the search.\",\"group_id\":1},{\"id\":\"s000017\",\"rating\":{\"coherence\":8,\"style\":5,\"grammar\":9,\"storytelling\":6,\"overall\":6},\"note\":\"Ben's lantern search succeeds and ends with reading beside Mum, though the prose is mostly a repetitive sequence of actions.\",\"group_id\":0},{\"id\":\"s000053\",\"rating\":{\"coherence\":7,\"style\":5,\"grammar\":9,\"storytelling\":5,\"overall\":5},\"note\":\"Sam borrows a spare key and returns it, but the lost key stays missing and the promised search is deferred.\",\"group_id\":1},{\"id\":\"s000021\",\"rating\":{\"coherence\":7,\"style\":5,\"grammar\":9,\"storytelling\":5,\"overall\":5},\"note\":\"Sam gets inside with a spare key and leaves a note about the unresolved original key; the ending is complete but somewhat inconclusive.\",\"group_id\":1},{\"id\":\"s000034\",\"rating\":{\"coherence\":8,\"style\":5,\"grammar\":9,\"storytelling\":6,\"overall\":6},\"note\":\"Nora locates the key under the bench and reaches the storybook, with clear events but little expressive detail.\",\"group_id\":0},{\"id\":\"s000048\",\"rating\":{\"coherence\":8,\"style\":5,\"grammar\":9,\"storytelling\":6,\"overall\":6},\"note\":\"Nora's lantern search solves the locked-door problem, although the repeated sentence pattern makes the story feel like an event log.\",\"group_id\":0},{\"id\":\"s000002\",\"rating\":{\"coherence\":8,\"style\":5,\"grammar\":9,\"storytelling\":6,\"overall\":6},\"note\":\"Lily finds the key and opens the cottage; the concrete ending is clear, but the narration is highly repetitive.\",\"group_id\":0},{\"id\":\"s000057\",\"rating\":{\"coherence\":8,\"style\":5,\"grammar\":9,\"storytelling\":6,\"overall\":6},\"note\":\"Lily finds the key with the lantern and gets to her book, in a coherent but mechanically repeated sequence.\",\"group_id\":0}],\"diversity\":{\"premise\":1,\"causal_path\":2,\"ending\":2,\"language\":1,\"overall\":1},\"diversity_evidence\":\"All twelve stories share the locked cottage and reading goal. Ten stories (s000014, s000028, s000058, s000023, s000017, s000034, s000048, s000002, s000057, and one? actually the set's remaining lantern-search story) follow the same lantern-and-found-key resolution; s000036, s000053, and s000021 instead use a spare key and defer finding the original. The language and final image of reading beside a parent remain nearly identical throughout. This describes only this sample.\",\"plot_groups\":[{\"group_id\":0,\"summary\":\"The child uses a lantern to find the missing key under a bench, unlocks the cottage, and opens a storybook beside a parent.\"},{\"group_id\":1,\"summary\":\"The child admits losing the key, borrows and returns a spare to enter, then leaves a note or promise to search for the original later.\"}]}",
